{
  "key": 19949,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_Nothing",
      "en_US": [
        "Smeargle needs something new to see.\r",
        "Win another Badge, then come back.\n",
        "New places, new paintings."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_Smeargle",
      "en_US": "Smeargle: Smea…"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_EaselAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "The paint on the canvas is moving…\n",
        "Step into the painting?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_SteppingIn",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} stepped into the painting!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_Canvases",
      "en_US": [
        "Canvases, stacked against the wall.\n",
        "Every one is a different place."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_Paint",
      "en_US": "Spilled paint. It’s still wet."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_PaintPot",
      "en_US": "A pot of paint, with a brush in it."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_CameBackEarly",
      "en_US": [
        "Back already? The painting will be\n",
        "there whenever you want to go in."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_Ready",
      "en_US": [
        "The canvas is ready. Step up to the\n",
        "easel whenever you like."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_NoBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! A visitor. Mind the wet paint.\r",
        "I paint trainers. Well, I paint the\n",
        "places trainers battle in.\r",
        "You don’t have a Badge yet, do you?\n",
        "Come back once you’ve won one.\r",
        "I might have something for you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_FirstIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "A Badge! Then you’ve battled a Gym\n",
        "Leader. Good. Look at my Smeargle.\r",
        "Its tail’s bare. It’s never painted\n",
        "in a color of its own.\r",
        "A Smeargle learns by watching, and\n",
        "it’s only ever watched me paint.\f",
        "It needs to see a real trainer\f",
        "battle. Up close. From the inside.\r",
        "My paintings are… a little more than\n",
        "paint. Step into one with Smeargle.\f",
        "Someone in there will battle you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_FirstAsk",
      "en_US": "Will you take Smeargle in with you?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_FirstGo",
      "en_US": [
        "Wonderful! I’ll set a fresh canvas on\n",
        "the easel. Touch it when you’re ready.\r",
        "Smeargle goes in first. Let it watch\n",
        "how you do things."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_NeedSmeargle",
      "en_US": [
        "Where’s Smeargle? Bring it along;\n",
        "it’s the one doing the learning."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_SketchIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Another Badge! Smeargle’s been\n",
        "watching you. It’s itching to learn.\r",
        "I’ll paint Quick Sketch onto it. In\n",
        "the painting, it can copy any one\f",
        "move the figure knows. Win, and the\f",
        "move is its own. Lose, and the\f",
        "paint washes off."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_SketchAsk",
      "en_US": "Shall we paint a new move?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_MegaIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "The Pokémon League! You’ve seen\n",
        "everything a trainer can see.\r",
        "There’s one painting I’ve never let\n",
        "anyone into. Someone in it carries\f",
        "a stone in every color there is."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_MegaAsk",
      "en_US": "Want to go and win it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_BothAsk",
      "en_US": "What shall we paint today?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_ANewMove",
      "en_US": "A New Move"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_TheMega",
      "en_US": "the Stone"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_EaselBlank",
      "en_US": [
        "A canvas on an easel. The paint is\n",
        "still wet."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_NoRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "Your party’s full. Make room for\n",
        "Smeargle first. A PC will do."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_TooFew",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a double battle in there.\n",
        "Bring another Pokémon along too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_Lend",
      "en_US": "Here, Smeargle. Go with them."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_Borrowed",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} borrowed Smeargle!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_FirstWon",
      "en_US": [
        "You won! And look at Smeargle’s tail!\r",
        "It’s found its color… and it’s yours.\n",
        "It was watching you, not the battle.\r",
        "Then it should stay with you. Take\n",
        "it. Take good care of my Smeargle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_ReceivedSmeargle",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received Smeargle!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_FirstExplain",
      "en_US": [
        "It knows Masterstroke: it paints\n",
        "with its own color, your type.\r",
        "After every Badge, come back. I’ll\n",
        "paint Quick Sketch onto it, and it\f",
        "can learn something new in a\f",
        "painting."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_FirstLost",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh dear. That figure paints hard.\r",
        "Smeargle still saw plenty, though.\n",
        "Rest up and try again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_Sketched",
      "en_US": [
        "Smeargle kept {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "It’s in its colors for good now."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_NoSketch",
      "en_US": [
        "You won, but Smeargle didn’t sketch\n",
        "a thing! The old move’s back.\f",
        "Try again whenever you like."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_SketchLost",
      "en_US": [
        "The paint washed off. Its old move’s\n",
        "back. Try again whenever you like."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_MegaWon",
      "en_US": [
        "You brought it back! The stone in\n",
        "every color. Here, it’s yours."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_MegaExplain",
      "en_US": [
        "Let Smeargle hold it, and it can\n",
        "Mega Evolve, like with any Mega\f",
        "Stone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_MegaLost",
      "en_US": [
        "That one’s hard to paint over. Rest\n",
        "up. The painting’s still there."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_Later",
      "en_US": "No hurry. The paint will keep."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0962_CV_CANVAS_PEWTER_PAINTER_LOFT_PainterLoft_Text_WhichType",
      "en_US": "What kind of move?"
    },
